[00:21.31]1. The way of the truth is the best way of living,
[00:28.31]But no one can live your life for you.
[00:34.31]So take the advice that Jehovah is giving;
[00:42.31]Believe what he tells you is true.
[00:46.17](Chorus)
[00:51.92]Make the truth your own.
[00:57.67]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[01:03.42]And then feel the joy
[01:09.17]Jehovah gives you
[01:12.38]When you make the truth your own.
[01:33.88]2. The effort you make and the time you are spending
[01:40.72]In service to God and his Kingdom
[01:47.55]Will yield rich results and a life that’s unending,
[01:51.15]A life full of good things to come.
[01:55.33](Chorus)
[01:59.52]Make the truth your own.
[02:04.52]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[02:11.52]And then feel the joy
[02:21.12]Jehovah gives you
[02:22.94]When you make the truth your own.
[03:05.28]3. Compared with our God, we are all little children
[03:08.86]And need his direction and counsel.
[03:15.40]So walk ev’ry day with our Father in heaven;
[03:20.73]Receive his rich blessing in full.
[03:25.23](Chorus)
[03:29.73]Make the truth your own.
[03:36.38]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[03:43.38]And then feel the joy
[03:46.05]Jehovah gives you
[03:48.71]When you make the truth your own.